## 15. Clean Public Formulation

> **Compounded Contextual Value is the accumulated epistemic and operational value that emerges inside a well-governed long-form human–AI collaboration. OA helps induce a temporary, ad hoc working ontology from operator-approved exemplars and sustained interaction. The broader ELT lattice preserves hierarchy, prevents capture, localizes uncertainty, archives inactive branches, and yields low-value continuation. As CCV compounds, sparse prompts can produce architecture-consistent synthesis with less repeated onboarding. The result is not omniscience. It is lower-friction co-development with an AI collaborator that increasingly understands the shape of the work.**

